100 INIT101 REM APPROXIMATE A CIRCLE WITH 24 SCALED TRIGONOMETRIC VECTORS105 PAGE107 REM EACH OF 24 VECTORS ADVANCES BY 15 DEGREES110 SET DEGREES115 REM SCALE THE FRAME AND CENTER ITS 97.5-UNIT HEIGHT120 S=130/1024125 REM CONNECT EACH ANGLE TO THE NEXT WITH ONE VECTOR130 FOR I=0 TO 23140 A=15*I150 X=512+360*COS(A)160 Y=390+360*SIN(A)170 B=512+360*COS(A+15)180 C=390+360*SIN(A+15)190 MOVE X*S,Y*S+1.25200 DRAW B*S,C*S+1.25210 NEXT I220 END